<section class="section section--soft work-evidence-section" id="learner-teamwork-venture"><div class="container story-block__grid story-block__grid--reverse"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">TEAMWORK & ENTREPRENEURSHIP</p><h2>Learning to build with other people.</h2><p>SkillsPark encourages learners to see technology as something they can build with other people, not only study individually. Some learners have come together as a team around their own platform or venture idea, combining different strengths and learning how collaboration, responsibility and shared thinking shape real projects.</p><p>Teamwork develops another layer of practical capability: communicating ideas, dividing responsibility, solving problems together and learning how individual skills contribute to a larger goal.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?= h(url('/training/programs')) ?>">Explore training pathways <?= icon('arrow') ?></a></div><div class="story-art work-story-media work-story-media--teamwork reveal"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-480.webp')) ?> 480w, <?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-768.webp')) ?> 768w, <?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-1200.webp')) ?> 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 50vw"><img src="<?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-768.jpg')) ?>" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-480.jpg')) ?> 480w, <?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-768.jpg')) ?> 768w, <?= h(asset('images/impact/learner-teamwork-venture/learner-teamwork-venture-1200.jpg')) ?> 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 50vw" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" alt="SkillsPark learners working together around a platform or venture idea."></picture></div></div></section>
